  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward if sentiment is neutral or negative (0.00) and model shows persistent overestimation.",
    "Reduce forecast peak values after sharp upward spikes — model tends to overshoot and fail to correct quickly.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if 3-5 consecutive days show high forecast error, dampen future forecasts toward recent 7-day average.",
    "For sentiment = 0.33, slightly increase forecast lag — model overreacts to sentiment signals, so delay peak response by 1-2 days.",
    "If true outcome is consistently lower than forecast over 10+ days, reduce forecast slope downward to avoid overconfidence in upward momentum."
  ]
